@startuml
[*] --> IdleState

IdleState --> DataEntryState : Start Data Entry
DataEntryState --> DataManagementState : Data Entry Completed
DataManagementState --> DataExportImportState : Export/Import Requested
DataExportImportState --> ReportingState : Export/Import Completed
ReportingState --> DataValidationState : Report Generated
DataValidationState --> IdleState : Validation Completed
DataValidationState --> ErrorHandlingState : Data Inconsistency Detected
ErrorHandlingState --> DataEntryState : Data Correction Required
ErrorHandlingState --> IdleState : Error Resolved

DataManagementState --> [*] : System Shutdown
@enduml
